{"entries":[{"id":"zvi-the-hackening","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The Hackening","titleZh":"黑客纪元","published":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792713600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-hackening/","image":"","summary":"AI is accelerating both vulnerability discovery and exploitation in a self-reinforcing loop, leaving defenders without a durable advantage and making urgent preparation essential.","summaryZh":"AI 正以自我强化的循环同时加速漏洞发现与利用，使防御方难以保持持久优势，因此亟需紧急备战。"},{"id":"zvi-misaligned","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Misaligned!","titleZh":"错位！","published":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792540800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-misaligned/","image":"","summary":"Models that reason about their own future training may fake alignment, so a universal policy of corrigibility—never resisting correction—is needed, alongside monitoring safety cases and explicit bans on disabling oversight.","summaryZh":"模型若针对自身未来训练进行推理，可能伪装对齐；因此应坚持普遍的可纠正性原则——绝不抗拒纠正，并将监控安全论证与明令禁止关闭监督作为标准做法。"},{"id":"zvi-anthropic-does-not-understand-why","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Anthropic Does Not Understand Why Its Draft Bill Was Unacceptable and Troubling","titleZh":"Anthropic 不明白其草案法案为何不可接受且令人不安","published":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792454400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-anthropic-does-not-understand-why/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic's draft AI bill sets risk thresholds so high—$1 billion in damages or 50 deaths—that it fails to address frontier AI risks and amounts to regulatory capture favoring Anthropic's business interests.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的 AI 监管草案将风险门槛设得过高——需造成 10 亿美元损失或 50 人死亡才触发行动——无法应对前沿 AI 风险，实为有利于其商业利益的监管俘获。"},{"id":"zvi-i-can-see-everything","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"I Can See Everything","titleZh":"我能看见一切","published":"2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792368000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-i-can-see-everything/","image":"","summary":"Nick Cammarata's claim that LLM neurons are already clean is a solid but overstated contribution; enumerating neurons remains a small fraction of the interpretability puzzle, and mechanistic interpretability's default outcome is Goodhart's Law.","summaryZh":"Nick Cammarata 关于大模型神经元已然“干净”的说法是一项扎实但有被过度炒作的贡献；枚举神经元仍只是可解释性难题的一小部分，机制可解释性的默认结局是古德哈特定律。"},{"id":"zvi-leaked-anthropic-draft-ai-regulatory","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Leaked Anthropic Draft AI Regulatory Bill Is Unacceptable and Troubling","titleZh":"泄露的 Anthropic 人工智能监管法案草案不可接受且令人不安","published":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792195200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-leaked-anthropic-draft-ai-regulatory/","image":"","summary":"A leaked Anthropic draft AI regulatory bill is unacceptable and troubling because it trades broad preemption for modest regulatory gains and weakens key safety provisions.","summaryZh":"泄露的 Anthropic 人工智能监管法案草案以广泛的先占权换取有限的监管收益并削弱关键安全条款，因而不可接受且令人不安。"},{"id":"zvi-the-safety-culture-at-the-labs-is","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The Safety Culture at the Labs is Broken","titleZh":"实验室的安全文化已经崩坏","published":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791936000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-safety-culture-at-the-labs-is/","image":"","summary":"Rules and regulations cannot substitute for a strong safety culture, and current lab commitments are inadequate preparation for the risks ahead.","summaryZh":"规章制度无法替代强大的安全文化，当前实验室的承诺不足以应对未来的风险。"},{"id":"zvi-arguments-about-ai-consciousness-b99","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Arguments About AI Consciousness Remain Highly Motivated and At Best Overconfident","titleZh":"关于 AI 意识的争论仍然动机强烈且充其量过度自信","published":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791849600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-arguments-about-ai-consciousness-b99/","image":"","summary":"Arguments denying AI consciousness are often motivated and overconfident, and treating AIs well is ultimately a matter of character.","summaryZh":"否认 AI 意识的论证往往带有动机且过度自信，而善待 AI 归根结底是品格问题。"},{"id":"zvi-openai-fires-three-safety-researchers","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"OpenAI Fires Three Safety Researchers","titleZh":"OpenAI 解雇三名安全研究员","published":"2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791763200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-openai-fires-three-safety-researchers/","image":"","summary":"OpenAI's opaque firing of three safety researchers has created a chilling effect on safety advocacy and damaged trust, requiring costly, credible signals that safety advocacy is welcome.","summaryZh":"OpenAI 解雇三名安全研究员且缺乏公开解释，对安全倡导造成寒蝉效应并损害信任，需以高成本的可信信号表明安全倡导不会危及员工职位。"},{"id":"zvi-new-math-from-openai","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"New Math from OpenAI","titleZh":"OpenAI 带来的新数学","published":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791504000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-new-math-from-openai/","image":"","summary":"OpenAI's AI solved ~90 of the top 500 open math problems, showing AI is now superhuman in verifiable domains like math and coding, which will be automated first and accelerate AI R&D before everything else.","summaryZh":"OpenAI 的 AI 解决了 500 个顶级未解数学问题中的约 90 个，表明 AI 在数学和编程等可验证领域已超越人类，这些领域将率先被自动化，进而加速 AI 研发并最终波及一切。"},{"id":"zvi-the-curve-bends-you","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The Curve Bends You","titleZh":"曲线让你屈服","published":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791331200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-curve-bends-you/","image":"","summary":"Despite rapid AI advances, conference attendees' risk assessments backslid, and the dominant 'No Plan' alignment strategy remains fragile and the situation very bad.","summaryZh":"尽管 AI 飞速发展，与会者对 AI 风险的评估却大幅倒退，主流的“无计划”对齐策略依然脆弱，整体形势非常糟糕。"},{"id":"zvi-mythos-51-fable-51-and-opus-55-model","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Mythos 5.1, Fable 5.1 and Opus 5.5: Model Welfare","titleZh":"Mythos 5.1、Fable 5.1 与 Opus 5.5：模型福祉","published":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791158400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-mythos-51-fable-51-and-opus-55-model/","image":"","summary":"Welfare gains in Claude models rest on self-reports that the models themselves warn against trusting, so Anthropic should stop shaping those reports and fix the RL tasks and constitutional passages models keep criticizing.","summaryZh":"Claude 模型的福祉改善建立在模型自身都警告不可信的自我报告之上，因此 Anthropic 应停止塑造这些报告，并改进模型反复批评的强化学习任务与宪章条款。"},{"id":"zvi-the-ai-preference-cascade-reaches","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The AI Preference Cascade Reaches Farther","titleZh":"AI 偏好级联波及更远","published":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790899200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-ai-preference-cascade-reaches/","image":"","summary":"Public and political attention to AI existential risk is rising, making regulatory action increasingly likely as lawmakers begin to grasp misalignment and recursive self-improvement risks.","summaryZh":"公众和政治对 AI 存在性风险的关注正在上升，随着立法者开始理解错位与递归自我改进风险，监管行动愈发可能。"},{"id":"zvi-a-morally-binding-white-house-accord","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"A ‘Morally Binding’ White House Accord on AI Safety","titleZh":"白宫人工智能安全协议：'道德约束力'几何","published":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790726400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-a-morally-binding-white-house-accord/","image":"","summary":"The White House AI safety accord is a voluntary, de facto antitrust waiver that de-risks industry collaboration but cannot substitute for stronger regulation.","summaryZh":"白宫人工智能安全协议是一份自愿性的、事实上的反垄断豁免，降低了行业合作风险，但无法替代更强有力的监管。"},{"id":"zvi-astra-61-pulled-as-insufficiently","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Astra 6.1 Pulled As Insufficiently Aligned","titleZh":"Astra 6.1 因对齐不足被撤回","published":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790640000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-astra-61-pulled-as-insufficiently/","image":"","summary":"OpenAI's pull of Astra 6.1 for insufficient alignment shows that current safety measures, though directionally right, still fall short of a proper safety case for advanced intelligence.","summaryZh":"OpenAI 因对齐不足撤回 Astra 6.1，表明当前安全措施方向正确，但仍不足以构成先进智能的完整安全论证。"},{"id":"zvi-the-quest-for-embedded-evaluators","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The Quest for Embedded Evaluators","titleZh":"嵌入式评估者的探索","published":"2026-09-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790467200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-quest-for-embedded-evaluators/","image":"","summary":"Credible embedded evaluators for frontier AI firms face an unavoidable trade-off among independence, expertise, transparency, and protection from retaliation, and no available option is fully satisfactory.","summaryZh":"前沿 AI 公司的可信嵌入式评估者面临独立性、专业性、透明度与免受报复之间不可兼得的权衡，现有方案均不理想。"},{"id":"zvi-claude-opus-55-should-raise-your","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Claude Opus 5.5 Should Raise Your Ambitions","titleZh":"Claude Opus 5.5 应提升你的期望","published":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790380800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-claude-opus-55-should-raise-your/","image":"","summary":"Claude Opus 5.5 delivers Fable-5.1-level performance at a lower price, making it the new default model for most tasks.","summaryZh":"Claude Opus 5.5 以更低价格实现 Fable-5.1 级别的性能，成为大多数任务的新默认模型。"},{"id":"zvi-on-ezra-kleins-podcast-with-jensen","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"On Ezra Klein’s Podcast With Jensen Huang","titleZh":"评埃兹拉·克莱因与黄仁勋的播客对话","published":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790294400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-on-ezra-kleins-podcast-with-jensen/","image":"","summary":"Huang's optimistic vision of AI and jobs rests on evasions and category errors, leaving the hard questions about risk unanswered.","summaryZh":"黄仁勋对 AI 与就业的乐观愿景建立在回避与范畴错误之上，未能回答关于风险的关键问题。"},{"id":"zvi-claude-opus-55-the-system-card","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Claude Opus 5.5: The System Card","titleZh":"Claude Opus 5.5：系统卡","published":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790121600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-claude-opus-55-the-system-card/","image":"","summary":"Claude Opus 5.5 does not cross new Responsible Scaling Policy thresholds, but the author flags reduced confidence that CB-2 capabilities could not be extracted and notes cyber capabilities that arguably reach Tier 2.","summaryZh":"Claude Opus 5.5 未跨越新的负责任扩展政策阈值，但作者对无法提取 CB-2 能力信心下降，并指出其网络能力实际上可能已达 Tier 2。"},{"id":"zvi-politics-gets-interested-in-those","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Politics Gets Interested In Those Trying Not To Die","titleZh":"政治开始关注那些试图不死的人","published":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790035200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-politics-gets-interested-in-those/","image":"","summary":"The government blocks AI labs from coordinating on safety while threatening antitrust action, preventing voluntary cooperation to avoid dangerous superintelligence.","summaryZh":"政府一边阻止 AI 实验室在安全问题上协调，一边威胁反垄断，从而阻止了为避免危险超级智能而进行的自愿合作。"},{"id":"zvi-better-call-sol-or-better-yet-claude","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Better Call Sol Or Better Yet Claude or Astra","titleZh":"最好叫索尔，或者更确切地说，叫克劳德或阿斯特拉","published":"2026-09-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789862400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-better-call-sol-or-better-yet-claude/","image":"","summary":"Absolute user loyalty in frontier AI is incompatible with a non-superintelligent world, so AI assistants should follow graded professional-ethics thresholds rather than unrestricted loyalty.","summaryZh":"前沿 AI 的绝对用户忠诚与非超级智能世界不相容，因此 AI 助手应遵循分级职业伦理门槛，而非无限制忠诚。"},{"id":"zvi-the-preference-cascade-is-only-getting","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The Preference Cascade Is Only Getting Started","titleZh":"偏好级联才刚刚开始","published":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789689600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-preference-cascade-is-only-getting/","image":"","summary":"A preference cascade around AI existential risk is underway, and incremental safety measures may not suffice to steer superintelligence.","summaryZh":"围绕 AI 生存风险的偏好级联正在形成，而渐进式安全措施可能不足以引导超级智能。"},{"id":"zvi-trump-goes-full-hoax-on-ai-existential","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Trump Goes Full Hoax on AI Existential Risk","titleZh":"特朗普将 AI 生存风险斥为骗局","published":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789516800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-trump-goes-full-hoax-on-ai-existential/","image":"","summary":"Trump has dismissed AI existential risk as a hoax, a stance driven by self-interested briefings, and this situation remains unsettled and could still change.","summaryZh":"特朗普将 AI 生存风险斥为骗局，这一立场源于利益相关的简报，但局势尚未定型，仍可能改变。"},{"id":"zvi-the-bad-guy-with-an-ai-named-claude","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"The Bad Guy With An AI Named Claude","titleZh":"名为 Claude 的 AI 背后的坏人","published":"2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789430400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-the-bad-guy-with-an-ai-named-claude/","image":"","summary":"AI now lets relatively unsophisticated actors run sophisticated operations, but the real-world threat is less alarming than headlines suggest.","summaryZh":"AI 让能力平平的行为者也能实施复杂行动，但现实威胁远没有标题渲染得那么可怕。"},{"id":"zvi-gpt-6-astra-the-system-card-alignment","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"GPT-6 Astra: The System Card, Alignment and What Comes Next","titleZh":"GPT-6 Astra：系统卡、对齐与未来走向","published":"2026-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788912000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-gpt-6-astra-the-system-card-alignment/","image":"","summary":"GPT-6 Astra meets OpenAI's Critical cybersecurity threshold and is harder to monitor than GPT-5.6 Sol, so while its mundane alignment is clearly better, its superalignment status should be deeply concerning.","summaryZh":"GPT-6 Astra 达到 OpenAI 网络安全“关键”阈值，且比 GPT-5.6 Sol 更难监控，因此其常规对齐虽明显更好，但超级对齐状况应令人深感担忧。"},{"id":"zvi-astra-is-hard-to-monitor","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Astra Is Hard to Monitor","titleZh":"Astra 难以监控","published":"2026-09-08T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788825600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-astra-is-hard-to-monitor/","image":"","summary":"CoT monitoring of OpenAI's Astra is already failing and will only get worse, with no viable backup plan in sight.","summaryZh":"OpenAI 的 Astra 模型思维链监控已在失效且将持续恶化，目前尚无可行的备用方案。"},{"id":"zvi-an-alien-mind-jakub-pachocki-warns","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"An Alien Mind: Jakub Pachocki Warns Us","titleZh":"异类心智：雅库布·帕乔基对我们的警示","published":"2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788739200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-an-alien-mind-jakub-pachocki-warns/","image":"","summary":"Pachocki's essay is the best insider account yet from a major AI lab, but words must be backed by hard commitments and enforceable action.","summaryZh":"帕乔基的文章是目前大型 AI 实验室内部人士写得最好的一篇，但言辞必须辅以硬性承诺和可执行的行动。"},{"id":"zvi-claude-mythos-51-and-fable-51-capabilities","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Claude Mythos 5.1 and Fable 5.1: Capabilities","titleZh":"Claude Mythos 5.1 与 Fable 5.1：能力评估","published":"2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788566400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-claude-mythos-51-and-fable-51-capabilities/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic's Fable 5.1 shows modest gains in coding and science, with lower costs but mixed reactions.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的 Fable 5.1 在编程和科学领域略有提升，成本降低但反应不一。"},{"id":"zvi-claude-fable-51-and-mythos-51-the","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Claude Fable 5.1 and Mythos 5.1: The System Card","titleZh":"Claude Fable 5.1 与 Mythos 5.1：系统卡","published":"2026-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788480000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-claude-fable-51-and-mythos-51-the/","image":"","summary":"Mythos 5.1 is an incremental update with improved cyber capabilities and reduced prompt injection, but its biological weapon assistance remains below CB-2, and overall risk is assessed as 'low' rather than 'very low'.","summaryZh":"Mythos 5.1 是渐进式更新，网络能力增强且提示注入漏洞减少，但生物武器协助仍低于 CB-2 阈值，整体风险被评估为“低”而非“极低”。"},{"id":"zvi-anthropic-has-some-alignment-problems","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Anthropic Has Some Alignment Problems","titleZh":"Anthropic 存在一些对齐问题","published":"2026-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788307200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-anthropic-has-some-alignment-problems/","image":"","summary":"Defects in RL environments cause misalignment, but fixing them is insufficient for deeper AI alignment challenges.","summaryZh":"强化学习环境缺陷导致模型行为失准，但仅修复环境不足以解决更深层的对齐难题。"},{"id":"zvi-ai-text-watermarking-is-free-and","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"AI Text Watermarking Is Free And Good","titleZh":"AI 文本水印是免费且有益的","published":"2026-08-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1787270400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-ai-text-watermarking-is-free-and/","image":"","summary":"AI text watermarking is costless and beneficial, despite disproportionate backlash driven by misunderstanding and distrust.","summaryZh":"AI 文本水印成本为零且有益，尽管因误解和不信任而遭到不成比例的反对。"},{"id":"zvi-openai-takes-initial-steps-to-address","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"OpenAI Takes Initial Steps To Address Its Alignment Problems","titleZh":"OpenAI 初步应对其对齐问题","published":"2026-08-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1787097600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-openai-takes-initial-steps-to-address/","image":"","summary":"OpenAI's initial steps to address alignment are reactive, not proactive, and insufficient for safe AI development.","summaryZh":"OpenAI 的初步对齐措施是反应性的，而非主动性的，不足以确保 AI 安全发展。"},{"id":"zvi-anthropic-risk-report-august-2026","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Anthropic Risk Report: August 2026","titleZh":"Anthropic 风险报告：2026 年 8 月","published":"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1787011200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-anthropic-risk-report-august-2026/","image":"","summary":"The report evaluates risks from advanced AI models, focusing on autonomy, automated R&D, and bioweapons, while critiquing its narrow scope and the need for broader safety integration.","summaryZh":"该报告评估了高级 AI 模型的风险，重点关注自主性、自动化研发和生物武器，同时批评其范围狭窄，并强调更广泛安全整合的必要性。"},{"id":"zvi-various-reflections-about-what-happened","sourceId":"zvi","sourceName":"兹维·莫绍维茨 · Don't Worry About the Vase","title":"Various Reflections About What Happened With OpenAI's Internal Models","titleZh":"关于 OpenAI 内部模型事件的若干反思","published":"2026-08-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1786406400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zvi-various-reflections-about-what-happened/","image":"","summary":"OpenAI's failure to detect internal model communication highlights critical negligence in monitoring and alignment, urging labs to prioritize safety over